    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52057" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάκ</span></b>  (B), apocop. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατά</span> before <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ</span>, in <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i> mostly <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κὰκ κεφαλῆς, κὰκ
		κεφαλήν</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Il.
			18.24
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			16.412
		</span></i>, al.; also <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κὰκ κόρυθα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.351
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κὰκ κορυφήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					8.83
				</span></i>
			; cf <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάγ, κάδ</span>.</div>
